# App Shell

Two machines: **Shell** (C# FSM) and **Simulation** (ECS).

## Elegant core (prefer this over jam GameDirector)

- `AppStateMachine` + `IAppState` (Enter/Exit)
- `GameSession` (Start/Dispose one run)
- `SimGate` Off | Running | Frozen
- `SceneLoader` (narrow)
- **Composition Root** wires them with `new` — VContainer optional later, never inside `ISystem`

## Do not treat as canon

Fat `GameDirector`, card Inject, soft restart via Find, economy pause via timeScale only.

